600	   365	     * their patrons are added to {@code into}'s (not {@code into} themselves, no repeats); anyone naming
601	   366	     * {@code from} as patron names {@code into} instead (no repeats). {@code from}'s holds, watchers and
602	   367	     * contact are dropped, and they are marked merged, leaving the list. {@code into}'s statement count
