131	    11	 * keeping the grades already recorded. A grade left as the row showed it (the one in force on the
132	    12	 * sheet's today) with the from-date blank records nothing. The form's terms are recorded from its
133	    13	 * terms from-date, keeping those already recorded; with the from-date blank they become the terms from
